00:11:48.530 --> 00:11:50.810
In particular,
some customers are

00:11:50.810 --> 00:11:53.750
really interested in
controlling for location,

00:11:53.750 --> 00:11:56.940
perhaps limiting access
to only certain countries.

00:11:56.940 --> 00:11:59.030
Additionally, if a company
is going through an org

00:11:59.030 --> 00:12:03.200
change or maybe a merger, being
able to change access policies

00:12:03.200 --> 00:12:06.200
for select groups of users
or departments in real time

00:12:06.200 --> 00:12:07.310
is crucial.

00:12:07.310 --> 00:12:09.500
And beyond these three
choices in the poll,

00:12:09.500 --> 00:12:11.630
there are many other ways
to customize your access

00:12:11.630 --> 00:12:15.360
policies based on what
your organization needs.

